OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's nurse meets Prince
OL,4,AHarry after award win
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse from Birmingham Children's
OL,7,FHospital has won a prestigious national
OL,8,Faward recognising her work supporting
OL,9,Fchildren with complex medical needs and
OL,10,Ftheir families.
OL,12,FRachel Shanahan was named the winner of
OL,13,Fthe Outstanding Nurse Award at the 2026
OL,14,FWellChild Awards in London last month,
OL,15,Fwhere she also met the charity's
OL,16,Fpatron, Prince Harry, the Duke of
OL,17,FSussex.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
