OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's nurse meets Prince
OL,4,AHarry after award win
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was selected from hundreds of
OL,7,Fnominations across the UK, in
OL,8,Frecognition of her dedication to
OL,9,Fimproving care for children and helping
OL,10,Ffamilies manage their needs beyond
OL,11,Fhospital.
OL,13,F"I suppose it was that validation of
OL,14,Feverything that you do, to see it in
OL,15,Fwriting and on stage and on the big
OL,16,Fscreen... it was lovely and really
OL,17,Fhumbling," she said.
